@startuml
title MyNetMate - Configuration component assembly\nbackend main @ 166e2ee | source-backed module boundaries | no device commands executed
left to right direction
skinparam componentStyle uml2
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam nodesep 35
skinparam ranksep 55
skinparam padding 10
skinparam componentBackgroundColor #F7FBFF
skinparam componentBorderColor #315A78
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFFBEA
component "Configuration Management (selected internal structure)" as ConfigSystem {
 component "versions : ConfigVersionModule" as Versions {
  portout " " as R_C01
  portout " " as R_C07
  portin " " as P_C03
 }
 component "drift : ConfigDriftModule" as Drift {
  portout " " as R_C02
  portout " " as R_C03
 }
 component "planning : ConfigPlanningModule" as Planning {
  portout " " as R_C04
  portout " " as R_C05
  portout " " as R_C06
  portin " " as P_C01
  portin " " as P_C02
 }
 component "render : TemplateRenderModule" as Render {
  portin " " as P_C04
 }
 component "diff : RemediationModule" as Diff {
  portin " " as P_C05
 }
 component "ssh : NetmikoAdapter" as SSH {
  portin " " as P_C06
  portin " " as P_C07
 }
 R_C01 -(0- P_C01 : C01: IConfigPlanning
 R_C02 -(0- P_C02 : C02: ILiveConfigPlanning
 R_C03 -(0- P_C03 : C03: IRecordConfigVersion
 R_C04 -(0- P_C04 : C04: IConfigRendering
 R_C05 -(0- P_C05 : C05: IRemediationPlanning
 R_C06 -(0- P_C06 : C06: IRunningConfigRead
 R_C07 -(0- P_C07 : C07: IConfigDeployIO
}
legend bottom left
 Square = UML Port (name suppressed). Socket = required; ball = provided.
 Each assembly joins two simple ports for ONE named interface.
 role : ComponentType denotes a part; types are logical software-module abstractions.
 Contract IDs map to operations and immutable source evidence in README / CONTRACTS.md.
 Render uses Jinja2; Remediation uses hier_config; SSH adapter uses Netmiko. They are NOT one component.
 db sessions are operation parameters; factory / ORM plumbing is omitted, not inferred.
 Main contains SSH push paths but no binding to the CIS gate in the inspected CIS branch.
 This is a code structure view, not a deployment approval, hardware-support claim or execution trace.
endlegend
@enduml

